  "content": "\n\n![](https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/RPG_Potions/MP_RPGPotions_header.webp)\n\n<div><div><div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: book antiqua, palatino, serif; font-size: 18px;\">RPG Potions – For PvP 新增一套專為 PvP 設計的藥水，旨在徹底改變玩家間的戰鬥方式。它們不僅僅是增加傷害或生命值，而是引入影響視野、機動性、敵情判斷與即時決策的效果，讓 PvP 更具策略性且難以預測。雖然主要為單挑與競技場設計，但其功能同樣適用於 PvE、團隊副本、陣營戰與自訂地圖，為整體遊戲體驗增添多樣性與深度。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: book antiqua, palatino, serif; font-size: 18px;\">多數藥水允許您透過模組的設定檔調整效果的強度、持續時間或行為模式。</span></p></div><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/RPG_Potions/MP_RPGPotions_description.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"2800\" height=\"230\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: book antiqua, palatino, serif;\">1 - 煙霧藥水：投擲後會釋放出煙霧雲，遮蔽該區域的視線，讓您能迷惑對手、擺脫追擊或隱藏行蹤。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: book antiqua, palatino, serif;\">2 - </span><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: book antiqua, palatino, serif;\">誘餌藥水：生成一個短暫的誘饵分身，模擬玩家的存在並分散敵人注意力，非常適合用於欺騙、引誘或計算好的脫身。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: book antiqua, palatino, serif;\">3 - 推斥藥水：產生衝擊波將附近的敵人推開，可用於拉開距離、將敵人逼入橋樑或高地，或中斷近戰攻擊。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: book antiqua, palatino, serif;\">4 - 幽靈護甲藥水：施加一層臨時保護，在數秒內完全免疫前 2-3 次受到的傷害，讓您能在不承受初期懲罰的情況下進出戰鬥。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: book antiqua, palatino, serif;\">5 - 輕度麻痹藥水：在數秒內降低對手的機動性與反應速度，使其在激戰中難以逃脫或即時反擊。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: book antiqua, palatino, serif;\">6 - 彈道反彈藥水：使您受到的投射物暫時反彈，讓它們飛回射手處並造成傷害，將遠程交火的優勢轉向您。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: book antiqua, palatino, serif;\">7 - 熱跡標記藥水：標記敵人，在限定時間內揭露其位置，讓您更容易追蹤、追捕並掌握隱匿玩家的動向。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: book antiqua, palatino, serif;\">8 - 黑漬藥水：使對手的螢幕變暗，在數秒內妨礙其視野以及瞄準或定位的能力。</span></p></div><div><p><span style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: book antiqua, palatino, serif;\"><strong>想和朋友一起遊玩嗎？</strong></span></p><p><a href=\"https://bisecthosting.com/thewizard\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/RPG_Potions/MP_RPGPotions_promo.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"2800\" height=\"350\"></strong></a></p><div><div><p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: book antiqua, palatino, serif;\"><a href=\"https://bisecthosting.com/thewizard\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><strong>立即擁有屬於您的 Minecraft 伺服器</strong></a></span><span style=\"font-family: book antiqua, palatino, serif;\">，與朋友暢享無盡冒險！憑藉頂尖效能與穩定運行時間，我們的伺服器保證為所有人帶來流暢愉快的遊戲體驗。使用優惠碼 <a href=\"https://bisecthosting.com/thewizard\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><strong>THEWIZARD</strong> </a>可享 </span><a href=\"https://bisecthosting.com/thewizard\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: book antiqua, palatino, serif;\">25% 折扣！</span></strong></a></span></p><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/FqhuAjYTGv\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/RPG_Potions/MP_RPGPotions_discord.webp\" width=\"2800\" height=\"230\"></span></a></p></div></div></div></div>",
